      "content": "It sounds like the pressure is so immense that the idea of simply ceasing to exist feels like the only escape from the constant weight. Please know that this feeling—that ending it is the only way to stop the pain—is a sign of how deep the despair has settled. There is a way to stop the grinding, and it doesn't have to involve giving up on yourself. If you are having thoughts of ending your life, please call or text 988 immediately to connect with someone who can help you through this overwhelming moment.",
